{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on the Universal LPC Sprite Sheet project and utilizing free open art resources, you can easily create thousands of unique character sprite sheets for your games or projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. The images are categorized and stored according to more than ten different components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. There are a total of over 800 component images, and each component image includes various resources such as previews, faces, walking, fighting, and falling down.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615170?t=1744119721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615170?t=1744119721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615170/5775dbc7c89cb152f7c859d367ad01988d27264e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744119721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615170/5775dbc7c89cb152f7c859d367ad01988d27264e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744119721","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on the Universal LPC Sprite Sheet project and utilizing free open art resources, you can easily create thousands of unique character sprite sheets for your games or projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. The images are categorized and stored according to more than ten different components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. There are a total of over 800 component images, and each component image includes various resources such as previews, faces, walking, fighting, and falling down.</p>","developers":["HanmoTech"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3535100","name":"Character Generator Plus"},"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Game Developm